                    <p> "I don't want to talk about it," I said embarrassingly. Then I went over to my table and placed down the few fruits I did manage to bring with me. "I thought you may be hungry so I brought you some things to eat. Unless succubi don't eat people's food?" I asked, not knowing anything about them.
